WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
Didn't you agree to wait for me to come over and do it together?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,400
Look, your eyes are all red.

3
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,560
Why don't you care about your body at all?

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:11,060
Dear brother

5
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,170
be let go

6
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:15,670
What are you afraid of when people see you?

7
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,310
This is our own home

8
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:22,180
How can I bear to let you do such menial work and heavy work in the future?

9
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:25,620
I'm responsible for making this place warm and cozy.

10
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:31,220
Let me eat the hot meal you cooked as soon as I get home

11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:36,960
Then you won’t be able to show off on your own in the future and listen to your wife’s wishes.

12
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,040
Let me show you how to braid it carefully

13
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:50,220
How did you come up with it?

14
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,500
I think I will save you two trips to carry water in the future and make you less tired.
